{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいでシャンプー全国握手会！\nついに終わりを迎えました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれたかた、ありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかげで、楽しいイベントになりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これなかったかたも、是非来てよねーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリカ様ファンのかたもまぁやと、握手してくれてありがとー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『狼に口笛を』\nを歌う前くらいに、\nせいらりんと\n『なんか寂しいねー狼もう最後だねー(*_*)』\nっというはなしをしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、披露できるとうれしいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走れbicycleも全国握手会があるみたいなので！\nそれにむけて練習しなきゃです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素晴らしい、アメイジングなステージにしたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はエリカ様と同じレーンでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリカ様と撮るときは写真の取り直しがずいぶんとあるものです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おかけで、あたしのフォルダはエリカ様だらけです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワッハッハッ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも沢山撮ってくれてありがとー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、新幹線の中では、ろってぃーちゃん！かずみん！まあやの三人で、ひたすら寝てました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アハハハ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホテルはひなちまと一緒でした！\n今度遊びに行く約束をしたよー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝るときは、ちまの携帯で音楽家聴きながら寝たんだけど 、途中でプチっときれて、\n『？中途半端にきれるね！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"』\nっというと、\n『.........。』\nちまをみると爆睡していた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと寝ながら、携帯のボタンを押していたのだろー......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の日ちまは、記憶が１つもなかったみたいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、今日のblogのタイトルは、\n意味わかんないですよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"意味はですねー、握手中、\n和田\n『今日のblogのタイトル決めてー！？』\nっていったら、\n嫌な顔１つせず、考えてくださいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとーに有り難うございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもなんか、少しタイトル間違えてる気がします..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"違ってたらすみませぇん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は貴方が当たるかもしれませんよ..............."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"www"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！洗濯物が終わったー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早くほさなきゃぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うきゃっ！\n枕カバーとふとんのカバーのアイロンもしなくちゃー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しわくちゃになっちゃうー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はシワが嫌いだーーーいっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あちゃ！大量の宿題はいつやろー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夕方からはレッスンがあったはず"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あちゃーいそがしーっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の夏は焼く派？焼かない派"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！この前は、まあやの質問に答えてくれてありがとー！\n大阪と言えば、おわらいとか、たこ焼きが多かったですねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"間違えた！バイバイじゃなくてー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せーーーーーのっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/16/1673682/0005.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}